Package: enigmars-utils
Version: 1.2.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: RishiSpace <rishikesh.giridhar@outlook.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/enigmars-project/enigmars-utils
Depends: python3 (>= 3.12), python3-pyside6 | python3-pyside6.qtwidgets, policykit-1 | polkitd
Recommends: sbctl, ufw, mpv | ffmpeg
Suggests: python3-pyside6.qtmultimedia
Description: Qt landing hub for Linux (tweaks, packages, kernels, Secure Boot)
 Enigmars Utils detects the distro, desktop, and package manager, then offers
 Windows-convert tweaks, package actions, kernel management, and sbctl-based
 Secure Boot setup. The GUI never runs as root; privileged work uses pkexec.
